{"id":"krem","lemma":"крем","pos":"noun","rank":2874,"glosses":["cream, creme"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9c/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"крема","plural":"кремы"},"examples":[{"text":"Мне нужен крем для рук.","en":"I need hand lotion.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null,{"g":"for"},null]},{"text":"Нанесите этот крем на своё лицо.","en":"Apply this cream to your face.","words":[{"g":"to drift","l":"нанести"},{"g":"this/that one"},null,{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"face"}]},{"text":"У тебя есть солнцезащитный крем?","en":"Do you have any sunscreen?","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null,null]},{"text":"Ты можешь нанести мне на спину немного крема для загара?","en":"Can you put some sunscreen on my back?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to drift"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"a little, some"},null,{"g":"for"},null]},{"text":"Том сказал, что мне нужно нанести солнцезащитный крем.","en":"Tom said I needed to put on some sunscreen.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"to drift"},null,null]}]}